    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightfall Secrets</strong> is a 4 vs 1 cooperative horror game that blends tension, strategy, and a gripping atmosphere. Four players must work together to complete a series of random objectives and escape before they fall victim to a supernatural, AI-controlled entity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with a Team:</strong> Play solo or with up to 4 players in co-op mode, working together to complete all missions and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listening AI:</strong> The enemy is AI-controlled with varying abilities, and it can hear player footsteps, dropped items, or communication sounds\u2014every noise can spell doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse AI Types:</strong> Each AI has a unique playstyle and abilities, from fast hunters to silent stalkers who manipulate the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Objectives:</strong> In every match, the objectives will change randomly, creating a fresh and challenging experience each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Environments:</strong> Explore dark and secret-filled places, from underground bunkers to abandoned buildings steeped in horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape or Become a Victim:</strong> Complete all objectives to open the escape route\u2014but the clock is ticking, and the AI will not stop its hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Different Experience Every Time:</strong> With AI variations, changing layouts, and randomized objectives, no two games will ever feel the same.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightfall Secrets</strong> is a 4 vs 1 cooperative horror game that blends tension, strategy, and a gripping atmosphere. Four players must work together to complete a series of random objectives and escape before they fall victim to a supernatural, AI-controlled entity.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with a Team:</strong> Play solo or with up to 4 players in co-op mode, working together to complete all missions and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listening AI:</strong> The enemy is AI-controlled with varying abilities, and it can hear player footsteps, dropped items, or communication sounds\u2014every noise can spell doom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse AI Types:</strong> Each AI has a unique playstyle and abilities, from fast hunters to silent stalkers who manipulate the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Objectives:</strong> In every match, the objectives will change randomly, creating a fresh and challenging experience each time you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chilling Environments:</strong> Explore dark and secret-filled places, from underground bunkers to abandoned buildings steeped in horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape or Become a Victim:</strong> Complete all objectives to open the escape route\u2014but the clock is ticking, and the AI will not stop its hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Different Experience Every Time:</strong> With AI variations, changing layouts, and randomized objectives, no two games will ever feel the same.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Nightfall Secrets is a 4v1 co-op horror game where up to 4 players must complete randomized objectives and escape\u2014while being hunted by an AI-controlled supernatural entity that reacts to sound. Every match is a tense battle of strategy, stealth, and survival.",
